Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:02.81,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Elias's paper had his obituary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:05.42,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It arrived a day\Nearly: his name,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.51,0:00:08.06,Midnight,,0,0,0,,his apartment, a fire at 3:07.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.01,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.89,0:00:11.78,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He had no subscription.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.78,0:00:15.16,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Underneath, in small\Nprint: one name per
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.16,0:00:19.36,Midnight,,0,0,0,,fire. At 2:40,\NElias knocked on 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.75,0:00:22.06,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's heater had been\Nsparking all week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.70,0:00:24.33,Midnight,,0,0,0,,She'd asked him to fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:25.93,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He told her to call the super.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.72,0:00:28.66,Midnight,,0,0,0,,He took the stairs\Nand didn't look
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:31.25,Midnight,,0,0,0,,back. From the\Nhotel, he watched the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:31.97,Midnight,,0,0,0,,smoke rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.97,0:00:35.51,Midnight,,0,0,0,,At 3:07, 4B burned.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.14,0:00:37.65,Midnight,,0,0,0,,The next paper\Nwaited at the front
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.65,0:00:39.49,Midnight,,0,0,0,,desk. Same fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:40.65,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Same hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.86,0:00:41.61,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Different name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.30,0:00:43.27,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara Kwan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.27,0:00:44.67,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Apartment 4A.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.06,0:00:46.83,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It said she'd entered 4B to warn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.83,0:00:49.88,Midnight,,0,0,0,,him. Elias laid the\Ntwo obituaries side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.88,0:00:50.82,Midnight,,0,0,0,,by side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.19,0:00:51.54,Midnight,,0,0,0,,His name.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.54,0:00:55.80,Midnight,,0,0,0,,Mara's. The paper wasn't\Npredicting the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.57,0:00:58.76,Midnight,,0,0,0,,It was choosing who paid for it.
